// spec: ERR-1
// expect-contains: before
// expect-stderr-contains: Uncaught: ArithmeticError: division by zero.
// expect-exit: 1
// Runtime error: dividing by zero throws (catchable). Uncaught at top level it
// aborts the program with exit 1, so "after" is never printed.
println("before");
let z = 10 / 0;
println("after");
